- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#43 (mes)
- "Wow~ You look like a novice. I do want to adventure with you someday when you grow up!"
+ "Uau~ Você parece novato. Quero muito me aventurar com você um dia, quando você crescer!"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#44 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#45 (mes)
- "Oh, now you are stronger than me. How did you grow so fast?"
+ "Ah, agora você está mais forte do que eu. Como cresceu tão rápido?"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#46 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#47 (mes)
- "I should find another adventurer who is similar with my level. It's been nice knowing you."
+ "É melhor eu procurar outro aventureiro do meu nível. Foi bom conhecer você."
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#48 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#49 (mes)
- "My name is Emily. I was waiting for someone who will go on adventures with me!"
+ "Meu nome é Emily. Eu estava esperando alguém para se aventurar comigo!"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#50 (select)
- "Who said I will adventure with you?"
+ "Quem disse que vou me aventurar com você?"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#51 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#52 (mes)
- "Well, come one. Don't be stern. Listen, you can decide after listening to my story. Of course, I can give you a proper reward."
+ "Ora, vamos. Não seja durão. Escute, você decide depois de ouvir a minha história. E claro, posso lhe dar uma recompensa à altura."
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#53 (select)
- "Proper Reward?"
+ "Recompensa à altura?"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#54 (select)
- "I'm not interested."
+ "Não estou interessado."
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#55 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#56 (mes)
- "How square! It's much better to be together!"
+ "Que quadrado! É muito melhor em dupla!"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#57 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#58 (mes)
- "Yes! Proper Reward."
+ "Isso! Recompensa à altura."
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#59 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#60 (mes)
- "It seems this Poring Village can be defeated by beginners just like us. It's just a wild guess though..."
+ "Parece que esta Vila dos Porings pode ser vencida por iniciantes como nós. É só um palpite, claro..."
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#61 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#62 (mes)
- "Well, actually I cannot give you the reward officially through adventurer association. But we can separate the income after hunting."
+ "Bem, na verdade eu não posso lhe pagar a recompensa oficialmente pela associação de aventureiros. Mas dá para dividir o que a gente ganhar na caçada."
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#63 (select)
- "But 50-50 sounds fair to me."
+ "Mas 50-50 me parece justo."
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#64 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#65 (mes)
