- "It's gotta be 50-50 or it's no good"
+ "Tem que ser 50-50, senão não vale"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#67 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#68 (mes)
- "How about 60-40!!"
+ "Que tal 60-40!!"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#69 (select)
- "50-50 ..."
+ "50-50 ..."
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#70 (mes)
- "[Emily]"
+ "[Emily]"
#: npc/re/instances/PoringVillage.txt#71 (mes)
- "This drives me crazy. OK, 50-50. Let's go with this."
+ "Isso me deixa louca. Está bem, 50-50. Vamos com isso."
